WEBVTT

00:05:59.778 --> 00:06:02.015
(Applause)

00:06:06.462 --> 00:06:07.770
Everything,

00:06:09.231 --> 00:06:10.999
everything must be taught,

00:06:12.197 --> 00:06:13.888
including compassion.

00:06:15.965 --> 00:06:22.187
If I see someone dying
on the street right now,

00:06:22.211 --> 00:06:25.051
I will do anything to save that person.

00:06:27.106 --> 00:06:29.006
But when I was in North Korea,

00:06:29.942 --> 00:06:34.283
I saw people dying
and dead on the streets.